WEBVTT

00:07:29.568 --> 00:07:32.238
and the tentacles were
searching out of the surface

00:07:32.262 --> 00:07:34.649
for something of nutritional value.

00:07:34.673 --> 00:07:37.154
The static-like sounds that are very low,

00:07:37.178 --> 00:07:39.158
that you're going to hear right now.

00:07:39.182 --> 00:07:43.560
(Static sounds)

00:07:43.584 --> 00:07:46.427
Yeah, but watch. When it
didn't find anything to eat --

00:07:46.451 --> 00:07:47.816
(Honking sound)

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.476
(Laughter)

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.973
I think that's an expression
that can be understood

00:07:52.997 --> 00:07:54.390
in any language.

00:07:54.414 --> 00:07:59.256
(Laughter)

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.856
At the end of its breeding cycle,